Register MAP and the bit functions 

0x00 CTRL1 REGISTER

	bits	name	descripton
	7:3		K		refclk_MHz - 16 (eg 27Mhz ref -> K = 11)
	2:2		LPT		lowpass enable (set=1, disabled=0)
	1:1		RX		RX path enable (set=1, disabled=0)
	0:0		SYN		Synthesizer enable (set=1, disabled=0)

0x01 CTRL2

	7:6		CO_DIV	clock out divider (0=/1, 1=/2, 2=/4, 3=/8)
	5:5		RSVD	reserved
	4:4		REFOUT_SEL	Reference output select
	3:0		BBGAIN	Baseband gain. val*2 (max 30 dB)

0x02 TNG0

	7:0		N_DIV[7:0]	N-divider LSB (lower byte of 12-bit word)

0x03 TNG1

	7:6		R_DIV	Reference predivide. ratio 1<<(val+1) (2,4,8,16)
	5:5		PRESC32_ON	Prescaler 0=/16, 1=/32
	4:4 	DIV4SEL VCO output divider. 1=/4 sub band (<1300MHz), 0=/2 (>1300MHz)
	3:0		N_Div[11:8] N-divider MSB

0x04 CTRL3

	7:7 	DCLOOP_OFF DC feedback loop disable
	6:6		RCCCLK_OFF 	LPF calibration clock (set=0, disabled=1)
	5:5		ICP		Chargepump current select
	4:0		LPF cuttoff BW=(CF+5)*2 MHz, range 10-72MHz

0x05 STAT1	

	2:2		CALVCO_STRT	VCO calib, set 1 to start, polled 0 when done
	1:1		CALRC_STRT	LPF RC calib, set 1 to start, auto polled 0 when done
	0:0 	LOCK	PLL lock state, locked=1

0x06 STAT2
unknown right now
0x07 STAT3 
unknown right now

Default POWER ON values
CTRL1	= 0x07 -> K=0, LPT=1, RX=1, SYN=1
CTRL2 	= 0x11 -> CO_DIV=0, REFOUT_SEL=1, BBGAIN=1 (2db)
TNG0	= 0xDC -> 220, (makes 0b 0101 1101 1100 thus 1500 in decimal)
TNG1	= 0x85 -> R_DIV=2 (/8), PRESC32=0, DIV4sel=0, N_DIV=5
CTRL3	= 0x17 -> RCCLK_OFF=0, ICP=0, CF=23 56MHz lpf
STAT1	= 0x01 -> read LOCK 
STAT2	= 0x
STAT3	= 0x
